TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-0905.0591v3
AU  - FRIEDL, STEFAN
AU  - VIDUSSI, STEFANO
TI  - A SURVEY OF TWISTED ALEXANDER POLYNOMIALS
DA  - D:20100208
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0905.0591
AB  - We give a short introduction to the theory of twisted Alexander polynomials of a 3–manifold associated to a representation of its fundamental group. We summarize their formal properties and we explain their relationship to twisted Reidemeister torsion. We then give a survey of the many applications of twisted invariants to the study of topological problems. We conclude with a short summary of the theory of higher order Alexander polynomials.
ER  - 
